---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white px-4 py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <div class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-2">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="flex items-center gap-2 text-indigo-600 hover:underline"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="h-4 w-4"
          >
            <path d="M19 12H5"></path>
            <path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
          </svg>
          Go Back
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto mb-8 flex max-w-2xl items-center gap-3">
        <h1 class="text-center font-sans text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">
          About Padyna
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="prose prose-indigo mx-auto max-w-2xl">
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
            What Padyna is
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
            Padyna is an AI customer support service. Businesses use it to build
            and deploy AI support agents that answer their customers' questions
            instantly, trained on the business's own content, and that hand
            conversations to a person on the team when a request needs one.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">How it works</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
            <li>
              Upload your business data: files, links to your website, or FAQs
              that give the agent the context it needs.
            </li>
            <li>
              Train the agent on that data so it answers accurately and cites
              the sources it used.
            </li>
            <li>
              Deploy it on your website chat widget and on WhatsApp, Slack,
              Telegram, or Discord, and handle customer queries on autopilot.
            </li>
            <li>
              When an inquiry becomes complex, the agent flags it and hands the
              conversation to your team, who can join live.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
            Who it is for
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
            Padyna is built for solopreneurs and early-stage startups, growing
            teams that need scale and collaboration, and scaling businesses and
            support agencies. Plans start with a free trial; see the <a
              href="/#pricing"
              class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">pricing</a
            > for message credits, chatbots, and team members on each plan.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
            Works with your tools
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
            Padyna connects to the tools teams already use, including Slack,
            Discord, WhatsApp, Telegram, Notion, Google Drive, Jira, ClickUp,
            Calendly, and Cal. Agent actions can run workflows from
            conversations, such as booking product demos, creating Jira tickets,
            processing refunds, or notifying the team in Discord.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="mb-8">
          <h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Get in touch</h2>
          <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
            Questions about Padyna? See the <a
              href="/contact"
              class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">contact page</a
            >, or <a
              href="https://app.padyna.com/register"
              class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">start a free trial</a
            >.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
